uzuhara Sorata, il quale viene trasportato in un mondo diverso e alternativo, un mondo che ricorda un misto fra l’epoca Meiji e quella Taisho. In questo strano luogo, il nostro protagonista si unisce ad un gruppo formato da 3 ragazze e 9 ragazzi, per fare un viaggio a bordo della Norn, una nave misteriosa, contenente una mini-città ed in grado di navigare in cielo. Come si evolverà la situazione?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Norn9","overview":"Guided by a strange, haunting song, elementary-schooler Sorata Suzuhara from the Heisei Era is warped back in time to 1919, in a high-tech ship called Norn9. This ship, flying above towns resembling that of the Meiji or Taishō period, harbours The Gifted, a group of three girls and eight boys with special abilities. As he tries to find a way to return to his time, he discovers incredible secrets about the world and spacetime itself."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"NORN9 ノルン+ノネット","overview":"少女はずっと独りだった。かつて彼女が出会った“旅人”はこう言う。｢その服が着られるぐらいになったら、迎えは来る｣　やがて17才になった彼女の前に、その船は現れた。空を征く船『ノルン』。導かれるままに乗った船には、『能力者』と呼ばれる10人の男女が暮らしていた。船はどこに向かっているのか？彼らはなぜ旅をしているのか？謎を抱えたまま運命に翻弄される旅が始まった。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r0ts9p6VN51pFeNIiW1vWRA9yd9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r0ts9p6VN51pFeNIiW1vWRA9yd9.jpg","language":"en","width":840,"height":1260},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/huhcKz75jx5kqs3W5AGQNTfxUd2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/huhcKz75jx5kqs3W5AGQNTfxUd2.jpg","language":"ja","width":840,"height":1260},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/av5aDNeUlFjvWZrdcaAtMotrQ42.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/av5aDNeUlFjvWZrdcaAtMotrQ42.jpg","language":"xx","width":600,"height":900}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wVTXBa90GZVqFsqZZZJ4fiGJqRG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wVTXBa90GZVqFsqZZZJ4fiGJqRG.jpg","langu